---
// Giscus 评论：参数与 Material overrides/partials/comments.html 完全一致，
// pathname 映射保证 URL 冻结后既有评论不丢失。
---

<section class="giscus-wrap">
  <h2 id="__comments">评论</h2>
  <script
    is:inline
    src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
    data-repo="gytxtx/Blog_Comments"
    data-repo-id="R_kgDOO28D8g"
    data-category="General"
    data-category-id="DIC_kwDOO28D8s4CrGKY"
    data-mapping="pathname"
    data-strict="0"
    data-reactions-enabled="1"
    data-emit-metadata="0"
    data-input-position="bottom"
    data-theme="preferred_color_scheme"
    data-lang="zh-CN"
    data-loading="lazy"
    crossorigin="anonymous"
    async
  >
  </script>
</section>

<script>
  // 明暗切换时同步 giscus 主题（等价于原 Material 主题联动逻辑）
  function syncGiscusTheme() {
    const iframe = document.querySelector<HTMLIFrameElement>('iframe.giscus-frame');
    const theme =
      document.documentElement.dataset.theme === 'github-dark' ? 'transparent_dark' : 'light';
    iframe?.contentWindow?.postMessage(
      { giscus: { setConfig: { theme } } },
      'https://giscus.app',
    );
  }

  document.addEventListener('themechange', syncGiscusTheme);
  // iframe 初始按 preferred_color_scheme 加载，手动选了明/暗时要在它首次回消息后纠正。
  // 每个 iframe 只纠正一次：setConfig 会触发 resize 消息，不设标记会来回循环。
  let syncedFrame: Element | null = null;
  window.addEventListener('message', (e) => {
    if (e.origin !== 'https://giscus.app') return;
    const iframe = document.querySelector('iframe.giscus-frame');
    if (!iframe || iframe === syncedFrame) return;
    syncedFrame = iframe;
    syncGiscusTheme();
  });
</script>
